  R -->|"types · mutability<br/>returned · caseExact"| D
  R --> DISC["/Schemas · /ResourceTypes<br/>/ServiceProviderConfig"]:::lib
  D --> V["Typed views<br/>ScimUserView · ScimGroupView"]:::lib
  D --> OUT["Response JSON<br/>returned + attributes projection"]:::ext

